{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb3a820e2c403915a0ad7e6f4138d476","RawContent":"I love this Patron idea. We have a large number of guests coming to the wedding. How did you transport that large amt into Mexico?","Attachments":[],"Id":107886,"PostDate":1189541458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love this Patron idea. We have a large number of guests coming to the wedding. How did you transport that large amt into Mexico?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our first year married. We had our marriage blessed at our Catholic Church.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cctexas1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1182197374,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207476.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisnessa","Id":207476,"Name":"chrisnessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37afac8bfdf7617a54bc12f55c34966c","RawContent":"I have the same question about the transport. I only have like 30 guests, but I want to put everything in one bag so it will be together, but it looks like from what I have been reading is that will more likely get your bag checked. So what happens then, you have to pay a tax or something??","Attachments":[],"Id":107910,"PostDate":1189544108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have the same question about the transport. I only have like 30 guests, but I want to put everything in one bag so it will be together, but it looks like from what I have been reading is that will more likely get your bag checked. So what happens then, you have to pay a tax or something??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"RobynE1111@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1181715918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207461.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RECancunBride","Id":207461,"Name":"RECancunBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4022f62581f7b49d8c692497802641a","RawContent":"We put all of our welcome bag things in three large luggage bags and luckily it got there okay. I just packed the patron bottles carefully with styrofoam sheets. The mini bottles are so cute and everybody went crazy over them. You should check with your WC to see if they are available in PV, although I doubt it. \n \n On our return we had expensive champagne bottles that my husband&#039;s family brought from France that we didnt want to leave in Mexico. We wrapped them in my juicy sweats and put them in our luggage and they got back okay too!","Attachments":[],"Id":108229,"PostDate":1189585484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We put all of our welcome bag things in three large luggage bags and luckily it got there okay. I just packed the patron bottles carefully with styrofoam sheets. The mini bottles are so cute and everybody went crazy over them. You should check with your WC to see if they are available in PV, although I doubt it. <br \/> <br \/> On our return we had expensive champagne bottles that my husband's family brought from France that we didnt want to leave in Mexico. We wrapped them in my juicy sweats and put them in our luggage and they got back okay too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Christine & Jeff<\/span><br><span>May 27, 2007<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"christine4979@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1188983112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christinepg","Id":207703,"Name":"christinepg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e2b6f648cafec940f75ac3c89af8621","RawContent":"Can you tell US where you purchased the Patron? Someone mentioned going to the Liquor Store and having them do this for us.?","Attachments":[],"Id":111284,"PostDate":1190138140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Can you tell US where you purchased the Patron? Someone mentioned going to the Liquor Store and having them do this for us.?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our first year married. We had our marriage blessed at our Catholic Church.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cctexas1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1182197374,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207476.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisnessa","Id":207476,"Name":"chrisnessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3a5c8cf49c677c359b96836309718bb","RawContent":"I got them in Vegas at the Aladdin mall at a very large tourist shop. I cant remember the name. It was an impulse buy, because as soon as I saw them I fell in love and had to get them. But I had to get more later from a beverage store in LA, Bevmo. They would probably have them at any large beverage shop.","Attachments":[],"Id":112073,"PostDate":1190233680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got them in Vegas at the Aladdin mall at a very large tourist shop. I cant remember the name. It was an impulse buy, because as soon as I saw them I fell in love and had to get them. But I had to get more later from a beverage store in LA, Bevmo. They would probably have them at any large beverage shop.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Christine & Jeff<\/span><br><span>May 27, 2007<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"christine4979@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1188983112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207703.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christinepg","Id":207703,"Name":"christinepg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aebd7f6cb6f77b4943f40948bcb9af12","RawContent":"I keep forgetting to tell about one of the great ideas we put in our oot bags, we put stick its, and pens. It was great since we had a large group and it was a large resort but our rooms were all in the same area. We would write little note&#039;s to one another, and stick them on our doors, like at the pool, gone to breakfast, on the beach. The stick it&#039;s let us know where to find one another, it was a good idea. Of course my stainless steal travel mugs was still our best idea!\n \n Kelly~","Attachments":[],"Id":112080,"PostDate":1190234726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I keep forgetting to tell about one of the great ideas we put in our oot bags, we put stick its, and pens. It was great since we had a large group and it was a large resort but our rooms were all in the same area. We would write little note's to one another, and stick them on our doors, like at the pool, gone to breakfast, on the beach. The stick it's let us know where to find one another, it was a good idea. Of course my stainless steal travel mugs was still our best idea!<br \/> <br \/> Kelly~\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dragonfly4hope13@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1176506040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207341.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dragonfly","Id":207341,"Name":"dragonfly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.16.83.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5478,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a7adb502a936718343db220d03ed291","RawContent":"This shop has some cute beach wedding totes:\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/EverlongEvents?section_id=16226008&amp;amp;ref=shopsection_leftnav_7&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/EverlongEvents?section_id=16226008&amp;amp;ref=shopsection_leftnav_7&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884901,"PostDate":1422850877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This shop has some cute beach wedding totes:<br>\n<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/EverlongEvents?section_id=16226008&ref=shopsection_leftnav_7' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ction_leftnav_7<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tknittle1218@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"63.240.140.104","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401651008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MommyDePoopster","Id":278188,"Name":"MommyDePoopster","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
